{"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/pushwooshnotificationui"]},{"paths":["\/documentation\/pushwooshnotificationui"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}]}],"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshNotificationUI\/documentation\/PushwooshNotificationUI\/PushwooshStoriesViewController"],"title":"Stories UI"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshNotificationUI\/documentation\/PushwooshNotificationUI\/StoryPage"],"title":"Payload model"},{"title":"Analytics","identifiers":["doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshNotificationUI\/documentation\/PushwooshNotificationUI\/PushwooshStoriesDelegate"]},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshNotificationUI\/documentation\/PushwooshNotificationUI\/PushwooshStoriesMediaPrefetcher"],"title":"Media pre-cache"}],"sections":[],"kind":"symbol","identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshNotificationUI\/documentation\/PushwooshNotificationUI"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[[]]},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Overview","anchor":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"PushwooshNotificationUI provides "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshNotificationUI\/documentation\/PushwooshNotificationUI\/PushwooshStoriesViewController","isActive":true},{"text":" — a drop-in","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"UNNotificationContentExtension"},{"type":"text","text":" view controller that renders an Instagram-style"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"stories experience: full-bleed images, top progress bars, auto-advance, tap-zone","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"navigation, per-frame title\/subtitle, and an optional deep-link button.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The module links only UIKit, UserNotifications, and UserNotificationsUI (plus"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"CryptoKit for a stable cache key), so it adds no Pushwoosh Core\/Framework weight"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to your memory-constrained extension process."}]},{"anchor":"Usage","text":"Usage","type":"heading","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"In your Notification Content Extension:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["import PushwooshNotificationUI","","class NotificationViewController: PushwooshStoriesViewController {}"]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Then set these keys in the extension’s Info.plist:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"UNNotificationExtensionCategory"},{"text":" = ","type":"text"},{"code":"PW_STORIES","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" (must match ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"aps.category"},{"text":")","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"UNNotificationExtensionUserInteractionEnabled"},{"type":"text","text":" = "},{"code":"YES","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"UNNotificationExtensionDefaultContentHidden"},{"text":" = ","type":"text"},{"code":"YES","type":"codeVoice"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"UNNotificationExtensionInitialContentSizeRatio"},{"type":"text","text":" = e.g. "},{"code":"1.5","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" (keep in sync with "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshNotificationUI\/documentation\/PushwooshNotificationUI\/PushwooshStoriesViewController\/storyAspectRatio"},{"type":"text","text":")"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NSExtensionPrincipalClass"},{"type":"text","text":" = "},{"code":"$(PRODUCT_MODULE_NAME).NotificationViewController","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" (code-only, no storyboard)"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"text":"Payload","anchor":"Payload","type":"heading","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The stories are described by a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"pw_stories"},{"text":" block, alongside an ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"aps.category"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"matching ","type":"text"},{"code":"UNNotificationExtensionCategory","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". The parser accepts the block either at","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the "},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"payload root","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" (e.g. via the Pushwoosh API ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ios_root_params"},{"text":") or inside the","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"custom-data container ","type":"text"},{"code":"u","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" \/ ","type":"text"},{"code":"userdata","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" (the Pushwoosh API ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"data"},{"type":"text","text":" field — delivered as"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"a dictionary or a JSON-encoded string). The root form on the device looks like this:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"json","code":["{","  \"aps\": { \"category\": \"PW_STORIES\" },","  \"pw_stories\": { \"pages\": [","    { \"image\": \"https:\/\/...\/1.jpg\", \"duration\": 5.0,","      \"link\": \"myapp:\/\/sale\", \"button_title\": \"Buy\",","      \"title\": \"Summer Sale\", \"subtitle\": \"Up to 70% off\" },","    { \"image\": \"https:\/\/...\/2.jpg\" }","  ]}","}"]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Sent through the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"data"},{"type":"text","text":" API field instead (recommended, since it does not depend on"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ios_root_params"},{"type":"text","text":"), the same block arrives nested under "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"u"},{"type":"text","text":" — while "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"aps.category"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"(and ","type":"text"},{"code":"mutable-content","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" for the pre-cache path) still go through "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ios_root_params.aps"},{"type":"text","text":","},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"as there is no dedicated request field for them. The relevant createMessage fields:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["{","  \"ios_root_params\": { \"aps\": { \"category\": \"PW_STORIES\", \"mutable-content\": 1 } },","  \"data\": { \"pw_stories\": { \"pages\": [ { \"image\": \"https:\/\/...\/1.jpg\" } ] } }","}"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"json"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The parser tries the root first, then "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"u"},{"type":"text","text":" \/ "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"userdata"},{"type":"text","text":", so both delivery styles work"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"and old pushes keep rendering."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Every field except "},{"code":"image","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is optional. ","type":"text"},{"code":"link","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" (like ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"image"},{"text":") must include a URL","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"scheme. A missing, empty, or malformed payload falls back to the default content"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"(the alert body) without crashing — override "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshNotificationUI\/documentation\/PushwooshNotificationUI\/PushwooshStoriesViewController\/showDefaultContent(for:)","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"text":"Analytics","level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"Analytics"},{"type":"paragraph","inli